WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
There is only six hours left during the day.

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,400
There are still six hours

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,000
Go ahead and chop five more.

4
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:11,020
Today's cutting method will yield a wooden barrel times thirty

5
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,340
There are still 70 days left to upgrade the wooden house.

6
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:16,280
Let's rest first

7
00:00:16,480 --> 00:00:17,880
It's getting dark and it's dangerous outside

8
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,760
We just happened to go back and try the bud meat.

9
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:21,920
Just no seasoning

10
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,600
Otherwise, I think it should be pretty good.

11
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:28,300
The water is almost gone

12
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:29,940
Find the guy who changes the water and change it some more.

13
00:00:29,940 --> 00:00:30,980
Change to some mountain spring water

14
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:34,860
Bucket, drink it so fast

15
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,500
Just think of it as the same old thing

16
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:39,020
One pound of meat costs twenty-five liters of water

17
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,860
Okay, but I have to go out and drink it.

18
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,260
I just went out to look for food today

19
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:44,260
Not much watering

20
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,540
OK, waiting for you
